{"4015120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Luce Spenta", "steam_appid": 4015120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4895820], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>You will be the judge of the dead… and every choice will be remembered.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">I am Morta, your guide in this place. I will show you the tombs, the broken lives, and the voices that still echo in the dark. But the verdict is yours alone.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015120/extras/7633f9c0d5ddfab07c354357504e8416.avif?t=1786227533\" width=1152 height=768 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">--------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luce Spenta</strong> is a gothic and psychological visual novel where power rests in your hands: you will decide the fate of five souls — forgiveness, reproach, oblivion, or execution.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌑 A gothic, dark atmosphere with detailed art and haunting soundscapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚖️ A moral journey that changes according to your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔀 More than 25 different endings reflecting the weight of your judgments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💀 Unexpected and disturbing moments that will test your will.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📖 A mostly narrative experience, perfect to accompany you for several days... or more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each grave hides a sin, and every story stirs a different feeling: compassion, anger, rejection, melancholy.<br>As you move forward, <strong>Morta</strong> will guide you through this path of broken voices and shattered memories… and what you uncover will also reveal who you truly are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">By looking and analyzing this page, you’re already a judge.<br><i>Luce Spenta</i> doesn’t begin when you play it, but when you decide to observe it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your eyes read… and Morta’s are already upon you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Your choices carry weight.</strong></i><br><i><strong>The tombs await your decision.</strong></i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>You will be the judge of the dead… and every choice will be remembered.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">I am Morta, your guide in this place. I will show you the tombs, the broken lives, and the voices that still echo in the dark. But the verdict is yours alone.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015120/extras/7633f9c0d5ddfab07c354357504e8416.avif?t=1786227533\" width=1152 height=768 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">--------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luce Spenta</strong> is a gothic and psychological visual novel where power rests in your hands: you will decide the fate of five souls — forgiveness, reproach, oblivion, or execution.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌑 A gothic, dark atmosphere with detailed art and haunting soundscapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚖️ A moral journey that changes according to your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔀 More than 25 different endings reflecting the weight of your judgments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💀 Unexpected and disturbing moments that will test your will.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📖 A mostly narrative experience, perfect to accompany you for several days... or more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each grave hides a sin, and every story stirs a different feeling: compassion, anger, rejection, melancholy.<br>As you move forward, <strong>Morta</strong> will guide you through this path of broken voices and shattered memories… and what you uncover will also reveal who you truly are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">By looking and analyzing this page, you’re already a judge.<br><i>Luce Spenta</i> doesn’t begin when you play it, but when you decide to observe it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your eyes read… and Morta’s are already upon you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Your choices carry weight.</strong></i><br><i><strong>The tombs await your decision.</strong></i></p>", "short_description": "Morta has summoned you to judge five souls trapped between salvation and oblivion. Enter their final memories, uncover what they hide, and decide their fate. In this gothic psychological trial, every verdict leaves a mark.", "supported_languages": "English, Italian, Spanish - Latin America, German, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Spain, French, Russian, Polish, Greek, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Japanese", "reviews": "“The story drew me in and kept me wanting to know more. Even without voice acting, I felt invested throughout.”<br>4.5/5 – NeverMoreNiche<br><br>“It is a haunting concept that relies on atmosphere, emotion, and reflection more than action, and it succeeds through its strong storytelling and moody presentation.”<br>8.4/10 – The Drastik Measure<br><br>“Luce Spenta does not aim to be lighthearted or escapist. It is an introspective, gothic, emotional, and morally challenging journey. A work constructed with a unique vision, where every soul judged leaves a mark. Even if you are not a fan of the genre, it is worth giving it a chance. It is a project that surprises, unsettles, and lingers.”<br>4.2/5 – 20xxNoticias<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015120/85fa91e035fd199c372f15a2aa6d94fbe955ea6e/header.jpg?t=1786227533", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015120/6988ce32b9e6b17272ae658ba59379664b77699c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786227533", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015120/6988ce32b9e6b17272ae658ba59379664b77699c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786227533", "website": "https://lucespenta.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 SP1 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.8 GHz Dual-Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 2.0 compatible<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5 GHz Dual-Core or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.0 compatible<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13 (High Sierra) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.8 GHz Dual-Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 2.0 compatible<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>